{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"杏林在線｜優雅渡過女性更年期\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/APP-ONLINE-I-WOMEN-261026.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】 女性踏入更年期，隨著荷爾蒙改變，會經歷潮熱和夜間盜汗，情緒及體態上也會出現很大變化。今集《杏林在線》請來港大醫學院臨床醫學學院婦產科學系名譽臨床助理教授許盈，跟我們講解有甚麼方法去紓緩更年期症狀。</p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T14:12:13.182127+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":107,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T13:30:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T20:38:07.784215+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T14:08:38.924408+00:00","content_hash":"b22dc3cd71b614e818f6fe24296626217226e91a9070109b88eaa09f58a3ad2b","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-26T14:12:13.182127+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}